      "id": "obs:10",
      "text": "A sovereign is said to smile and approve the poet's strain.",
      "category": "speech",
      "evidence_refs": [
        "ev:4"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "obs:11",
      "text": "Mahmud is praised as lord of several realms, fierce like a tiger on land and like a crocodile on the waters of the Nile.",
      "category": "attribute",
      "evidence_refs": [
        "ev:5"
